  "_comment": [
    "The base game's makes and countries (see docs/modding.md, \"cars\"). Every mod's cars/*.json is merged key by key over",
    "these: a mod adds a make, or changes one figure of one, naming only that; a list (a make's words) is taken whole.",
    "makes: by id. words: what in a car's brand (else its name) tells the make, any case, two words allowed; family: the",
    "corporate family its cars and engines belong to (a Pontiac turns up with a Chevrolet V8, never a Hemi), none for a make",
    "whose words name no engine; country: a country's id or name; common: added to how common its cars are (0 rare to 1",
    "common). A badge does nothing to a car's price: a car costs what it does, its body and its parts.",
    "countries: by id, with the other names a ui_car.json writes for them and the regions they are in.",
    "words: aliases (a nickname read as the word it stands for) and noise (words that say nothing about which car or",
    "engine it is), for matching a car's name to an engine's."
  ],
